<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; WORD-BREAK: break-all; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US>1.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">活动前，班主任要做好安全教育和调查工作，体质特殊和身体不佳的学生，不宜参加。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; WORD-BREAK: break-all; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US>2.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">出发前以及返回学校，班主任都要组织专人清点人数；班主任活动中要随带家长联系电话，保证紧急情况下的即时联系。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; WORD-BREAK: break-all; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US>3.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">学生</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">必须严守纪律，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">不得相互超越，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">不得追逐打闹，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">不得私自离队，不得带手机，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">严禁乱丢垃圾。要做到一切行动听指挥，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">严格遵守集合时间。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">自备矿泉水。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; WORD-BREAK: break-all; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: red; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US>4. </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: red; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">在步行过程中，注意安全，按时到达集合地点，整队乘车返校，乘车费用学生自理<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>上车买票（每生<SPAN lang=EN-US>10</SPAN>元），周一中午<SPAN lang=EN-US>12</SPAN>：<SPAN lang=EN-US>30</SPAN>公交公司派人来校收费，地点在行政楼一楼接待室旁。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
